msgctxt "7828_Akiyama"
msgid "(Not the ending I expected, but whatever.) "
msgstr "(No es el final que me esperaba, pero me da igual). "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7948_Akiyama"
msgid "Nice. You look like a brand new man!"
msgstr "Genial. ¡Pareces hombre nuevo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7960_Akiyama"
msgid "Now, time for a little practice!"
msgstr "¡Es hora de practicar!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7972_Taniguchi"
msgid "Wha－!? But this isn't your club! It's Miki I'm after!"
msgstr "¡¿Qu - ?! ¡Pero este no es tu club! ¡Es Miki a quien quiero conquistar!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7984_Akiyama"
msgid "You idiot. Miki's one tough cookie. But I guess I don't need to tell that to the guy who spent five million yen on her. "
msgstr "No seas idiota. Miki es un queso duro de roer. Pero supongo que no hace falta decírselo a un tipo que gastó cinco millones de yenes en ella. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7996_Taniguchi"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8008_Akiyama"
msgid "She's not the kind of girl you can get simply by dressing the way she likes. You'll need to learn the right things to say to her. "
msgstr "No es el tipo de chica que puedes conquistar simplemente vistiéndote de la manera que le gusta. Necesitarás aprender que cosas decirle para conquistarla. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8020_Akiyama"
msgid "Now it's time for a crash course in talking to girls at this club. "
msgstr "Es hora de un curso intensivo sobre como hablarle a las chicas de este club. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8032_Taniguchi"
msgid "What!? You're not gonna bail on me, are you? "
msgstr "¡¿Qué?! No irás a abandonarme, ¿verdad? "

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=14
msgctxt "8044_Akiyama"
msgid "It wouldn't be much of a crash course if I stuck around. I'll just give you some advice. "
msgstr "No sería muy intensivo si me quedara cerca. Solo te daré algunos consejos. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=15
msgctxt "8056_Akiyama"
msgid "I see... Okay, give it another shot. "
msgstr "Ya veo... está bien, intentalo otra vez. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8068_Akiyama"
msgid "Women like their men assertive. If you see one you like, go on the offensive! "
msgstr "A las mujeres les gustan los hombres seguros de si mismo. Si ves a una que te guste, ¡ve a la ofensiva! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8080_Taniguchi"
msgid "Okay! "
msgstr "¡Ok! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8176_Taniguchi"
msgid "Akiyama-san!"
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8188_Akiyama"
msgid "How'd it go? "
msgstr "¿Cómo te fue? "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8200_Taniguchi"
msgid "I picked a girl and tried to be assertive, but she said I was annoying and told me to get lost. "
msgstr "Me acerqué a una chica e intenté ser seguro de mí mismo, pero me dijo que era demasiado molesto y me echó. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8212_Akiyama"
msgid "It's important to start by letting her know what you're like. You're already dressed to kill, so now it's time to try selling your strong points. "
msgstr "Es importante comenzar haciéndole saber como eres. Ya estás vestido para conquistarla, pero ahora es fundamental saber vender tus puntos fuertes. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8224_Taniguchi"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "¡Está bien!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8320_Taniguchi"
msgid "Akiyama-san!"
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8332_Akiyama"
msgid "How'd it go?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te fue?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8344_Taniguchi"
msgid "I picked a girl and tried to sell myself to her, but it didn't work. "
msgstr "Me acerqué a una chica e intenté venderle mis puntos fuertes, pero no funcionó. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8356_Akiyama"
msgid "What did you say to her? "
msgstr "¿Qué le has dicho? "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8368_Taniguchi"
msgid "I thought she'd understand me more if I told her about my favorite anime and action figure collection, but she said I creeped her out! "
msgstr "Pensé que ella entendería mi forma de ser si le hablaba sobre mis animes favoritos y de mi colección de figuras de acción, ¡pero me ha dicho que le di repelús! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8380_Akiyama"
msgid "To paraphrase that famous Shakespearean quote, \"Fickleness, thy name is woman.\" "
msgstr "Parafraseando esa famosa cita de Shakespeare, \"Inconstancia, tu nombre es mujer.\" "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8392_Akiyama"
msgid "They're always changing their minds. You have to figure out how they feel and respond properly. "
msgstr "Siempre cambian de opinión. Tienes que arreglártelas para saber como se sienten y responder acordemente. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8404_Taniguchi"
msgid "I... I see... "
msgstr "Ya... Ya veo... "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8416_Akiyama"
msgid "What I'm trying to say is it's more important to listen to them than it is for you to talk. "
msgstr "Lo que estoy tratando de decirte es que es más importante escucharlas a ellas que hablar tú. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8428_Akiyama"
msgid "By listening, you can sense her mood, which makes it easier for you to respond. But that's normally a hostess's job to do just that. "
msgstr "Escuchándolas, puedes captar su estado de ánimo, lo que te facilita responderles. Pero, en general, eso es trabajo de las hostess. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8440_Akiyama"
msgid "In any event, you'll get far with a hostess by getting on her good side. But, whatever. You need the practice. Good luck! "
msgstr "En cualquier caso, llegarás lejos con una hostess cayéndole bien. Pero, como sea. Necesitas práctica. ¡Buena suerte! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8452_Taniguchi"
msgid "Thanks. "
msgstr "Gracias. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8464_Akiyama"
msgid "Go get 'em, tiger! "
msgstr "Ve por ellas, ¡tigre! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8476_Taniguchi"
msgid "Okay! "
msgstr "¡Ok! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8572_Taniguchi"
msgid "Akiyama-san!"
msgstr "¡Akiyama-san!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8584_Akiyama"
msgid "How'd it go?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te fue?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8596_Taniguchi"
msgid "I tried listening just like you said, and it worked! I guess girls like it when guys do that! It went really well! "
msgstr "Intenté escucharlas tal y como me dijiste, ¡y funcionó! ¡Supongo que a las chicas les gusta cuando los chicos hacen eso! ¡Me ha ido muy bien! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8608_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent! "
msgstr "¡Excelente! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8620_Taniguchi"
msgid "I think I'm getting the hang of this! "
msgstr "¡Creo que le voy pillando el truco a esto! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8632_Akiyama"
msgid "Great! Then why don't you go see Miki now? "
msgstr "¡Genial! Entonces, ¿por qué no vas a ver a Miki ahora? "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8644_Taniguchi"
msgid "I can't. I have a date with a hostess from this club. "
msgstr "No puedo. Tengo una cita con una hostess de este club. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8656_Akiyama"
msgid "A date? But what about Miki? "
msgstr "¿Una cita? ¿Y qué pasa con Miki? "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8668_Taniguchi"
msgid "I'm so over Miki. Would you mind telling her that for me, Akiyama-san?"
msgstr "Ya superé a Miki. ¿Te importaría decírselo por mí, Akiyama-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8680_Akiyama"
msgid "You mean all this training was a waste of my time?"
msgstr "¿Me estás diciendo que todo este entrenamiento fue una perdida de tiempo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8692_Taniguchi"
msgid "Not at all! Thanks to you, I'm a new man! I really appreciate your help! "
msgstr "¡Para nada! ¡Gracias a ti, soy un hombre nuevo! ¡De verdad que agradezco tu ayuda! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8704_Taniguchi"
msgid "I'd like to give you this as a thank you. I won't be needing it anymore. "
msgstr "Me gustaría darte esto como un agradecimiento. Ya no lo necesitaré más. "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8740_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8752_Taniguchi"
msgid "Well, I'm off! Goodbye! "
msgstr "¡Bueno, ya me voy! ¡Adios! "

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8764_Taniguchi"
msgid "Okay, Ryoko, let's go! "
msgstr "¡Ok, Ryoko, vámonos! "

